Deployment artefacts land here at build time: svm_freq72.onnx, resnet_se_cd.onnx,
resnet_se_cd.onnx.data and reference_outputs.npz.

resnet_se_cd.onnx.data holds the ResNet's external weights and MUST be deployed alongside
the .onnx file. Shipping the graph without it produces a container that starts cleanly and
fails on first inference.
